## Artwork NOTICE

This package also ships theme artwork (logos, sprites, and in-game scene
screenshots) under `src/styles/` and base64-inlined in `lib/client.js`. That
artwork is **© ConcernedApe (Stardew Valley)** and is bundled here solely for
**personal, non-commercial fan use**. It is **not** covered by the MIT license
above. If you publish or redistribute this package, you are responsible for
determining whether redistribution of the artwork is permitted.
